{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,0],[1000016,-1],[1000017,0],[1000018,100],[1000019,0],[1000020,0],[1000021,0],[1000022,4],[1000023,99000002],[1000024,0],[1000025,90000000],[1000026,0],[1000027,90000001],[1000028,2],[1000029,1100003],[1000030,2000],[1000031,4000],[1000032,6000],[1000033,10000],[1000034,0],[1000035,0],[1000036,34],[1000037,35],[1000038,36],[1000039,31],[1000040,32],[1000041,33],[1000042,27],[1000043,28],[1000044,38],[1000045,39],[1000046,3],[1000047,25],[1000048,26],[1000049,30],[1000050,37],[1000051,10],[1000052,40],[1000053,41],[1000054,42],[1000055,43],[1000056,24],[1000057,65],[1000058,66],[1000059,53],[1000060,80]],"messages":{"1000000":"I'm glad to meet you.\nMy name is Alex. I'm the commander of this town.\n","1000001":"I heard about your story from Ostare.\nHe said you have excellent talents.\nI suspect you can help us then.\n","1000002":"Well, let me explain about the current situation.\n","1000003":"Goblins attacked us the other day.\nYou see, Goblin attacks are not unusual, but\ntheir methods of attack have been strange lately.\n","1000004":"Their attacks were fairly random in the past,\nbut now their raids have become skillful and well organized.\nIt seems like someone is giving direction to them.\nI hope it's just my imagination.\n","1000005":"Your duty is to sweep the Goblins around this town.\nYou'll find several ruins, but do not go too deep within them.\nGoblins live there and modify the structure\nto suit their convenience.\n","1000006":"Take it easy.\n","1000007":"How are you doing?\nThere is no information right now.\nYou've worked hard. Good job.\n","1000008":"If you're staying in this town for a while,\nbe nice to the people.\n","1000009":"Oh, it's you.  I was waiting for you.\nWe received new information a short time ago.\n","1000010":"According to a scouting party's report,\nthere seems to be a giant monster living in the Cold Ruins\nnorthwest of this town.\n","1000011":"Because of your efforts, the Goblins around here\nhave become very quiet.  Your current duty has been completed.\n","1000012":"Well, now I give you a new mission.\nSweep the monsters in the Cold Ruins.\n","1000013":"Other soldiers also must have headed for the ruins.\nGood luck.\n","1000014":"You worked really hard.\nI heard about your efforts from the other soldiers.\nThis is a reward for your work.  Please take it.\n","1000015":"By the way, communications with the scouting party\ndispatched to the Purgatory of Judgments was cut off recently.\nYour duty is to scout the Purgatory of Judgments\nand destroy the monsters as soon as you find them.\n","1000016":"In addition to hearing about the Golem at the Cold Ruins,\nwe've also heard that monsters seem to be more active these days.\nPlease be careful.\n","1000017":"You made it!\nWe are very happy with your efforts.\nHere is a reward for your work. Please take it.\n","1000018":"After assessing the situations at the Cold Ruins and the Purgatory of\nJudgments, we've decided that monsters seem to start their activities\nby creating their homes in the ruins.\n","1000019":"There are some ruins near here that we call the Remains of\nReincarnation.  Although we haven't had a reliable source of\ninformation yet, it is clear that monsters might be active there too.\n","1000020":"I'll give you a new mission.\nScout the Remains of Reincarnation\nand destroy the monsters and demons when you encounter them.\n","1000021":"We understand you are tired, but we need your help.\nWe do this to regain peace in this town.\n","1000022":"Thank you for your efforts.\nI am always impressed by your hard work.\nThis is a reward for you.  Please take it.\n","1000023":"According to your report, a road to a different town has been opened\nfrom the inner section of the Remains of Reincarnation.\nI'll dispatch a scouting party to scout the area.\n","1000024":"I also want you to scout the land.\nIf you find something, please let me know immediately.\n","1000025":"I'm counting on you.\nGood luck.\n","1000026":"Good job. Your report drew my attention.\nI didn't know that it is possible to get to another area\nfrom the Remains of Reincarnation.  This new area may be\nthe Immortal Remains we've heard about in local legends.\n","1000027":"There is a strong likelihood that the monsters around here\nkeep their base in the Immortal Remains.  I'll give you a mission.\n","1000028":"Go out to the Immortal Remains and scout it.\nDestroy the monsters as soon as you find them.\n","1000029":"This may be our last battle.\nWe've dispatched all our soldiers to the Immortal Remains.\nI expect you to destroy the monsters, too.\n","1000030":"Great job!!\nWord is that you defeated the legendary Gargoyles.\nThank you for your efforts.\nHere is a reward.  Please accept it.\n","1000031":"It seems that peace has been restored around this area.\nGo ahead and rest for awhile, but you may also train yourself\nat the Tower of Ordeal if you want to.\n \nAs for the Tower of Ordeal, the Wizard Izaram\nliving in the west of town knows about it.\n","1000032":"You've accomplished your duty in this area.\nTake a break for a while.\nThank you very much for your efforts.\n","1000033":"Your next duty has been decided.\nHead for the Mining Town which is located\nfar south of the Remote Town and ask for instructions.\n","1000034":"My name is Salam.\n \nThis area is too cold for me because I come from the south.\nI want to go home right after I finish my mission.\n","1000035":"Have you seen the merchant in this town?\nHe has a brother in the Remote Town.\n","1000036":"Oh, I was impressed by your work!\nYou destroyed the monsters in the ruins, right?\n","1000037":"You take care of yourself.\nThe commander of this town tends to push soldiers very hard.\n","1000038":"There has been a strange rumor among soldiers recently.\nThey say, \"When the snow stops, a Gargoyle appears...\"\n","1000039":"As for snow, we haven't had snow in days.\n","1000040":"My name is Ajis.\n \nPresently, I'm a guard for Commander Alex.\n","1000041":"Commander Alex is a great person.\nIf we follow him, we won't make any mistakes.\n","1000042":"Who are you? I haven't seen you before.\n","1000043":"My name is Carls.\nI want to be a knight some day!\n","1000044":"Gedo, who lives in the northern part of town,\nused to be a knight.\nHow wonderful it would be to be a knight!\n","1000045":"Rosanna seems depressed.\nWould you cheer her up?\n","1000046":"Rosanna is happy now.\nThank you very much!\n","1000047":"Who are you?\n","1000048":"Are you a new hired warrior?\nMy name is Rosanna.\n","1000049":"My fiance was killed in an attack the other day.\nI don't know what to do with my life now...\n","1000050":"It seems he was killed by Wild Ice who lives northwest of this town.\nA ruby which he treasured is missing from his body.\nIt was a memorable ruby shared between him and me.\n","1000051":"Sir, would it be possible for you\nto return the ruby to me? At any cost?\n","1000052":"Please, please return the ruby.\n","1000053":"That must be the memorable ruby that was shared between my fiance and me!\nOh! Thank you very much!\nFinally, he can rest in peace.\n","1000054":"This is a present for finding the ruby.\nI am thankful for your efforts.\n","1000055":"Thank you again\nfor taking back the ruby.\n","1000056":"Oh, you must be the new hired warrior?\nI have been waiting for you!  Listen to my story!\n","1000057":"I used to be a knight when I was young, and\nI destroyed many monsters one after another!\n","1000058":"Nowadays, soldiers are weak compared to me!\nWhy are they taking so much time to defeat the Goblins?\n","1000059":"Well..\nWhere are you going?\n","1000060":"You came back to listen to the rest of my story?\n.....Hey, where are you going?\n","1000061":"I have been waiting for you.\n.....Wait a second.\nThis is an important story.\n","1000062":"You seem to be a promising young warrior.\nI have a favor to ask of you.\n","1000063":"I ordered an item from a merchant in the Remote Town\nbut have not received it yet because of the monster attacks.\n","1000064":"I see you are strong, so I want you to bring it back.\nI am too old to go there.  If I could move my body like before,\nI could take it back by myself.\n","1000065":"I'm counting on you!\n","1000066":"Oh, you brought it back like you promised.\nYou are such a nice, young man.\n","1000067":"This is an item which I used to use when I was younger.\nIt is useful.  With your skills, you can handle it.\n","1000068":"......Where is my sweet daughter?\n","1000069":"That's strange...\nShe was here a little while ago.\n","1000070":"Please bring back my daughter!!\n","1000071":"Would you like to trade something?\nOr shall I repair or identify your items?\n \n \u30fb~Trade                 ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                               ~QUIT~\n","1000072":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000073":"It seems you are running short of money.\n","1000074":"Well, you don't need to repair it.\n","1000075":"To identify your item, it costs %d of Gold.  Is that OK?\n \n                                  ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000076":"You have no unidentified items.\n","1000077":"My name is Molse.\nI run my business in this town.\n","1000078":"I heard about your story from my brother.\nYou have defeated many monsters, haven't you?\nI'm glad to meet you.\n","1000079":"I am Maria, a holy spirit witch.\n","1000080":"Come to see me when you get hurt or tired.\n","1000081":"......It's free.\n","1000082":"Holy spirits!\nHeal the evil wounds!!\n","1000083":"You look fine.\n","1000084":"My name is Izaram.\nI am a wizard, but probably not a great one.\n","1000085":"Are you a recently hired warrior?\n...Well, you have eyes that shine.\n","1000086":"I'll give you some useful information.\n","1000087":"There are three ruins and a tower around here.\n       The Cold Ruins to the northwest,\n       Purgatory of Judgments to the southeast,\n       Remains of Reincarnation to the southwest,\nand the Tower of Ordeal to the north of this town.\n","1000088":"Even though our great ancestors created buildings and towns\nto guard the ruins, monsters have still been able to occupy the\nthree ruins as their homes. Please pay attention to those places.\n \nRegarding the Tower of Ordeal,\nwizards keep it under their control.\nIf you want to test your ability, go to the tower.\n","1000089":"I have a bad feeling about the creatures in this area.\nThey may cause more damage than the lower-order monsters\nlike the Goblins. Be sure to take care of yourself.\n","1000090":"I heard you defeated the Gargoyles from the Immortal Remains.\nThat is quite an achievement.\n","1000091":"Do you want to train yourself harder\nat the Tower of Ordeal to the north of this town?\nI will tell my companions about you.\n","1000092":"Good luck.\n","1000093":"Fang\n \n ~Check Status~ \n ~Explanation~\n ~Swap Dogs~\n \n           ~QUIT~\n","1000094":"I am different from the other dogs in the remote town.\n","1000095":"...Of course, some of us are inferior to\nthose in the remote town.\n","1000096":"Hello, my name is Coloch, a blacksmith.\nI specialize in ornaments.\n","1000097":"Do you want to change the color of your equipment\nto give it a new, refreshing feeling?\n","1000098":"Cold Svalt Town\n","1000099":"Cold Svalt Town\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,0,12000000,2],[0,1,12000000,25],[0,0,12000001,47],[0,1,12000001,54],[0,0,12000002,58],[0,1,12000002,62],[0,0,12000003,64],[0,1,12000003,70],[0,0,12000004,74],[0,1,12000004,82],[0,0,12000005,88],[0,1,12000005,97],[0,0,1